                <p>An API attack is a cyber-attack that attempts to manipul=
ate API functionality for malicious purposes. Successful API attack outcome=
s include gaining unauthorized access to sensitive data, abusing business l=
ogic to use the API unexpectedly, and denial of service (DoS) attacks that =
prevent legitimate API use.</p>
